<title>DUBAI: ADNOC lifts September crude prices $1.80-$1.85.</title>
<headline>ADNOC lifts September crude prices $1.80-$1.85.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abu Dhabi National Oil Company (ADNOC) on Tuesday said it had increased the price of its crude lifted in September by $1.80-$1.85 a barrel.</p>
<p>Murban, Lower Zakum and Umm Shaif are up $1.85 at $22.30, $22.35 and $22.00 respectively.</p>
<p>Upper Zakum is $1.80 higher at $20.55 a barrel.</p>
<p>-- Dubai Newsroom, +971 4 6071255.</p>
</text>
